The following is the message history between the user and an AI assistant.

Message history:
```
{{ message_history }}
```

Create a BPMN representation of the process described in the messages.

Choose the form that fits the description:
- If the description is about a single process (one actor/organization, even if it has several roles), output a single `{"process": [...]}`.
- If the description involves multiple independent participants that each do internal work and exchange messages, output a collaboration `{"participants": [...], "message_flows": [...]}`.
- If the description is specifically about the message-exchange protocol between participants (who sends what to whom, in what order) rather than each party's internal work, output a choreography `{"participants": [...], "choreography": [...]}`.

Output only the JSON object, nothing else.